                    "Now the caveat that should be stapled to every one of those numbers.  This is Tubefilter's first Gospel Stats brand report since YouTube changed what counts as a view to include the first frame playing, including an autoplay nobody asked for, and Tubefilter notes a general rise in counts across the board.  This brief has run the size of that gap before: across more than 75,000 videos a public count sits about 1.67 times above the engaged-view count on identical footage.  So 56,792,187 is a bigger number than the equivalent video would have shown in July, and nobody is restating last year's charts to match.",
